# Example repo list for scripts/pull-repos.sh
#
# One absolute path per line. Blank lines and lines starting with '#' are
# ignored. This project is single-repo, so the only entry most people need is
# this checkout itself — pull-repos.sh still fast-forwards it and reports
# whether HEAD moved, which is useful before a Sync pass.
#
# Copy this file to repos.txt at the repo root (which is what pull-repos.sh
# reads by default, and which is gitignored since the path is machine-local).
#
# /home/you/workspace/badge.temporal.io
